OL,3,ATanzania's VP expelled from ruling
OL,4,Aparty for indiscipline and his
OL,5,Asuccessor named
OL,6,
OL,7,FEmmanuel Nchimbi has been expelled from
OL,8,FTanzania's ruling Chama Cha Mapinduzi
OL,9,F(CCM) party for indiscipline following
OL,10,Fhis decision earlier this week to
OL,11,Fresign as the country's vice-president
OL,12,Fafter 10 months in the job.
OL,14,FThe 54-year-old has made some
OL,15,Fcontroversial remarks in recent weeks -
OL,16,Fincluding urging Tanzanians to "fight
OL,17,Ffor a new constitution" - pointing to a
OL,18,Fpossible fallout with President Samia
OL,19,FSuluhu Hassan.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
