OL,3,ATanzania's VP expelled from ruling
OL,4,Aparty for indiscipline and his
OL,5,Asuccessor named
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe was Samia's running mate in last
OL,8,FOctober's disputed presidential
OL,9,Felection, which saw hundreds killed in
OL,10,Fpost-poll unrest.
OL,12,FEnergy Minister Deogratius Ndejembi,
OL,13,F43, has been nominated as his
OL,14,Freplacement and his name will now be
OL,15,Fpresented to parliament for approval.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
